age\" title=\"Danish language\">Danish</a> – directed by <a href=\"/wiki/Magnus_von_Horn\" title=\"Magnus von Horn\">Magnus von Horn</a></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Seed_of_the_Sacred_Fig\" title=\"The Seed of the Sacred Fig\">The Seed of the Sacred Fig</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/List_of_German_submissions_for_the_Academy_Award_for_Best_International_Feature_Film\" title=\"List of German submissions for the Academy Award for Best International Feature Film\">Germany</a>) in <a href=\"/wiki/Persian_language\" title=\"Persian language\">Persian</a> – directed by <a href=\"/wiki/Mohammad_Rasoulof\" title=\"Mohammad Rasoulof\">Mohammad Rasoulof</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div style=\"border:none; background-color:#F9EFAA;color: #202122; width:auto; margin:0; text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Academy_Award_for_Best_Documentary_Feature_Film\" title=\"Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature Film\">Best Documentary Feature Film</a></b></div>\n<ul><li><b><i><a href=\"/wiki/No_Other_Land\" title=\"No Other Land\">No Other Land</a></i> – <a href=\"/wiki/Basel_Adra\" title=\"Basel Adra\">Basel Adra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rachel_Szor\" title=\"Rachel Szor\">Rachel Szor</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hamdan_Ballal\" title=\"Hamdan Ballal\">Hamdan Ballal</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Yuval_Abraham\" title=\"Yuval Abraham\">Yuval Abraham</a> ‡</b>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Box_Diaries\" title=\"Black Box Diaries\">Black Box Diaries</a></i> – <a href=\"/wiki/Shiori_It%C5%8D\" title=\"Shiori Itō\">Shiori Itō</a>, Eric Nyari, and Hanna Aqvilin</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Porcelain_War\" title=\"Porcelain War\">Porcelain War</a></i> – <a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Bellomo\" title=\"Brendan Bellomo\">Brendan Bellomo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Slava_Leontyev\" title=\"Slava Leontyev\">Slava Leontyev</a>, Aniela Sidorska, and Paula DuPré Pesmen</li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Soundtrack_to_a_Coup_d%27Etat\" title=\"Soundtrack to a Coup d&#39;Etat\">Soundtrack to a Coup d'Etat</a><